      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792781143241,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Like transparent sheets on a\nprojector: each sheet adds or\nchanges a few files. Look down\nthrough the whole stack and you\nsee one complete set of folders.\nThat view is what a container\nstarts with.\n\nLayers never change once built.\nA new build makes new sheets on\ntop.",
      "originalText": "Like transparent sheets on a\nprojector: each sheet adds or\nchanges a few files. Look down\nthrough the whole stack and you\nsee one complete set of folders.\nThat view is what a container\nstarts with.\n\nLayers never change once built.\nA new build makes new sheets on\ntop.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "no35ye4scmej",
